# M12: the Save changes question shows which button has the focus: Yes first, then Tab and the arrows move it, Enter presses it.
@copy plain.qld
@open PLAIN.QLD
x                                 # the document is modified
f10 end enter                     # File > Exit asks to save: Yes has the focus
tab                               # No
tab                               # Cancel
tab                               # round to Yes
left                              # Cancel
enter                             # Cancel presses: back to the document
f10 end enter                     # ask again
right                             # No
enter                             # No: exit without saving
